Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(asks): two assistant-only rounds, then the owner
 answers (1688, part 1)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A5 (D679/D680): the helper asks „which city?", the asker's assistant answers
from the goal, the helper asks again, and nobody has typed. Without a cap the
two assistants can loop.

Migration 220 adds task_asks.a2a_rounds. Each ask is stamped with the count: a
reply after an answer with no owner words since is one more round; the owner's
own words, his line sent by the server, a relay or the evening card start
again at 0. At 2, a third assistant-only ask is refused before anything is
sent (reason owner_must_answer), and the model is told to bring the question
to the owner.

HOLD: the refusal's model-facing line is §108, pending Misho's yes (D44,
NIGHT_QUESTIONS AJ). Part 2 (the pre-filled „other" box) follows with 1696.

DONE WHEN: a fictional seat whose assistant is made to answer two clarifying
questions in a row does not send a third; the owner is asked instead.

